{"id":"ics-034","stemHtml":"<p>已知寄存器与内存的初值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li<code>%rax = 0x1000</code>，<code>%rbx = 0x20</code>，<code>%rcx = 0x8</code>；</li>\n<li>内存地址 <code>0x1048</code> 处存放 8 字节的值 <code>0xCAFEBABE</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>回答下列问题。</p>\n<p>（1）<code>movq 0x10(%rax), %rdx</code> 访问的有效地址是多少？</p>\n<p>（2）<code>movq (%rax,%rbx,4), %rdx</code> 访问的有效地址是多少？</p>\n<p>（3）执行 <code>leaq 8(%rax,%rcx,8), %rdx</code> 后 <code>%rdx</code> 的值是多少？这条指令访问内存吗？</p>\n<p>（4）执行 <code>movq 8(%rax,%rbx,2), %rdx</code> 后 <code>%rdx</code> 的值是多少？</p>\n<p>（5）如果把操作数写成 <code>(%rax,%rbx,3)</code>，会发生什么？比例因子允许取哪些值？</p>\n<p>（6）<code>movq -8(%rax), %rdx</code> 的有效地址是多少？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>x86-64 的有效地址公式是「基址 + 变址 × 比例因子 + 位移」。<code>lea</code> 只计算地址、不访存；<code>mov</code> 在算出地址后还要读内存。比例因子只能是 1、2、4、8，对应 1/2/4/8 字节的元素。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p>（1）只有基址和位移：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1010.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x1000+0x10=0x1010.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1010.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>（2）基址 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span> 变址 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span>：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>80</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1080.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x1000+0x20\\times4=0x1000+0x80=0x1080.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1080.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>（3）基址 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span> 变址 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times8+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span> 位移：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1048.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x1000+0x8\\times8+8=0x1000+0x40+0x8=0x1048.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1048.</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<code>lea</code> 只把算出的地址写入 <code>%rdx</code>，不读内存，所以 <code>%rdx=0x1048</code>，与内存里存的是什么无关。</p>\n<p>（4）先算地址：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1048</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x1000+0x20\\times2+8=0x1000+0x40+0x8=0x1048,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1048</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n正好是题目给出的地址，所以 <code>movq</code> 从该处读出 8 字节：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0xCAFEBABE</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\%rdx=\\texttt{0xCAFEBABE}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0xCAFEBABE</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n对比（3）：同样得到 <code>0x1048</code>，但一个是地址、一个是内存内容。</p>\n<p>（5）非法。x86-64 的 SIB 寻址中比例因子只有 2 位，只能表示 1、2、4、8 四种取值（分别对应 <code>char</code>、<code>short</code>、<code>int</code>、<code>long</code>/指针的步长）。写 3 会导致汇编器报错。</p>\n<p>（6）基址加负位移：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mn>8.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x1000-0x8=0xFF8.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">8.</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n有效地址允许是任意 64 位数，不要求「看起来像合法地址」；是否真能访问由运行时决定。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是把 <code>lea</code> 当成 <code>mov</code>，回答「从 <code>0x1048</code> 读出 <code>0xCAFEBABE</code>」——<code>lea</code> 根本不访存。二是算 <code>(%rax,%rbx,4)</code> 时忘了乘比例因子，写成 <code>0x1020</code>。三是把比例因子 3 当成合法值，或以为可以取任意整数。四是把负位移当成错误：<code>-8(%rax)</code> 就是 <code>%rax-8</code>，完全合法。五是混淆 AT&amp;T 与 Intel 语法中操作数的顺序。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>（1）<code>0x1010</code>；（2）<code>0x1080</code>；（3）<code>rdx=0x1048</code>，不访问内存；（4）从 <code>0x1048</code> 读出 <code>0xCAFEBABE</code>；（5）非法，比例因子只能取 1、2、4、8；（6）<code>0xFF8</code>\n"}